      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TRAPPER TEARS (5) last start finished 5th in a Mix 3/4 on September 25 over 350m at Goulburn behind Silent Accord beaten 5.5 lengths (20.39). Looks well placed and should feature. YOGEN BALE (8) drifted back settling but did best work late to finish 4th at Richmond over 320m (18.98). Has a good winning strike rate at this journey. The form from his last run stacks up well. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. APPIN WAY (2) dropped out early but hit the line hard, charging into second and beaten 5 lengths win (19.75) at this track in Mix 3/4. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings seven times from 11 attempts. Can feature again. LONG ISLAND BLUE (1) found the frame here last start and looks a top-three hope again.",
